WEBVTT

00:06:59.583 --> 00:07:02.143
that you know you probably
should be focusing on more,

00:07:02.167 --> 00:07:03.458
would you agree?

00:07:04.708 --> 00:07:08.018
Educated, you spent a few years in --

00:07:08.042 --> 00:07:10.518
Say yes again, the word "yes" quickly?
Jessica: Yes.

00:07:10.542 --> 00:07:12.309
DB: No?
Jessica: No.

00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:14.726
DB: California? Berkeley?
A bit of a guess, but ...

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.643
Jessica: I went to Berkeley, yes.
Stop doing this!

00:07:17.667 --> 00:07:19.309
DB: So it's a yes.

00:07:19.333 --> 00:07:21.518
Oh, and you've been
to India recently as well.

00:07:21.542 --> 00:07:24.851
There's just a tiny, tiny little thing
going on there. Yes? No?

00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:26.851
Jessica: Yes, I just got back from India.

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:30.768
DB: It's a yes from me, I just don't want
to say it like it's written in the stars